> error dsq_dw ~ dsq
error of dsq_dw against dsq:
  max abs error 0 at -
  max rel error 0 (0%) at -
  mean rel error 0 over 65536 points
  max 0 ulp
  rounding, first order in u = 2^-24: 6 rounded operations, each taken as correctly rounded, and 7 in error-free transformations; relative to the value, the largest over 4096 inputs
    error-free transformations: 1 2Sum (s + t = a + b, Knuth), 2 2Prod (p + e = a b by an fma while |a b| >= 2^-102); taken as exact, so the errors of the sums and products they correct cancel to first order where the result adds the error terms back; what is left is of order u^2, not in these lines (`dword` derives it)
    the preconditions hold at every input of the sample (checked, not proved)
    worst case  5.96e-08 (1 u): every error at its bound and aligned, u sum |c_i|
    probable    no better than the worst case: 4 u sqrt(sum c_i^2) is 4 u here (it gains from about 16 operations of similar weight on)
    expected    3.44e-08 (0.577 u): the root mean square if they are independent and uniform in [-u, u]
    for 6 operations of equal weight: gamma_6 = 6 u / (1 - 6 u) = 3.58e-07, gamma~_6(4) = 4 sqrt(6) u = 5.84e-07
